        {
          "content": "This unified sampling document is a clearance level 1 document. The following personnel may sign sampling documents:\n\n- Researchers (Up to their own clearance),\n- Site Administration, Foundation Command (and their assistants),\n- Medical Consultants+ when required for medical purposes.\n\nAuthorization can be given for a maximum of >3< liters. Expiration: Research >7< days, otherwise >3< days.",
